{
    "title": "buz - voice connects",
    "description": "buz is a voice-centric messaging app that makes communication effortless, faster, more natural and engaging, bridging age and language barriers with a simple push-to-talk interface. Connect with loved ones on mobile phone and tablet,  sharing your thoughts and feelings, just like you would in person.\r\n\r\n\uff5e Push-to-talk\r\nWe all know talking is faster. Skip the typing and get your thoughts across directly, just press our big green button and let your voice carry your message!  \r\n\r\n\uff5e Auto-play Messages\r\nNever miss a message again! Hear your loved ones' voicemails even with your phone locked, thanks to our auto-play feature.  \r\n\r\n\uff5e Voice-to-text\r\nCan't listen to a voice message right now? Whether at work or in a meeting, our voice-to-text feature transcribes them instantly, so you can catch up on the go!\r\n\r\n\uff5e Group Chat\r\nGather the crew together and dive into a lively group chat where every conversation is packed with fun! Invite your friends to share laughs, inside jokes, and instant banter\u2014because chatting is always better with a crowd!\r\n\r\n\uff5e Multitasking\r\nStay connected without missing a beat! buz overlays seamlessly on your screen, letting you chat and multitask while gaming, scrolling, or anything else you love.\r\n\r\n\uff5e AI Buddy\r\nbuz is equipped with AI-powered features like instant translation in 26 languages (and counting!) and an AI assistant to answer your questions, share fun facts, and offer travel advice. Think of buz as your always-on, awesome friend and helpful sidekick, no matter where you go.\r\n\r\n\r\nChat with your friends, make voice calls, and enjoy the fun. It's easy to add folks from your contacts or share your buz ID.\r\n\r\nPssst\u2026 Make sure you\u2019re connected to WiFi or have a data plan to enjoy smooth chatting and avoid unexpected charges.\r\n\r\n\r\nWant to help us make buz even better?\r\nWe value your feedback and want to hear your thoughts! Share your suggestions, ideas, and experiences with us:\r\nEmail:  buzofficial@vocalbeats.com\r\nOfficial website: www.buz.ai\r\nInstagram: @buz.global\r\nFacebook: buz global\r\nTiktok: @buz_global",
    "descriptionHTML": "buz is a voice-centric messaging app that makes communication effortless, faster, more natural and engaging, bridging age and language barriers with a simple push-to-talk interface. Connect with loved ones on mobile phone and tablet,  sharing your thoughts and feelings, just like you would in person.<br><br>\uff5e Push-to-talk<br>We all know talking is faster. Skip the typing and get your thoughts across directly, just press our big green button and let your voice carry your message!  <br><br>\uff5e Auto-play Messages<br>Never miss a message again! Hear your loved ones&#39; voicemails even with your phone locked, thanks to our auto-play feature.  <br><br>\uff5e Voice-to-text<br>Can&#39;t listen to a voice message right now? Whether at work or in a meeting, our voice-to-text feature transcribes them instantly, so you can catch up on the go!<br><br>\uff5e Group Chat<br>Gather the crew together and dive into a lively group chat where every conversation is packed with fun! Invite your friends to share laughs, inside jokes, and instant banter\u2014because chatting is always better with a crowd!<br><br>\uff5e Multitasking<br>Stay connected without missing a beat! buz overlays seamlessly on your screen, letting you chat and multitask while gaming, scrolling, or anything else you love.<br><br>\uff5e AI Buddy<br>buz is equipped with AI-powered features like instant translation in 26 languages (and counting!) and an AI assistant to answer your questions, share fun facts, and offer travel advice. Think of buz as your always-on, awesome friend and helpful sidekick, no matter where you go.<br><br><br>Chat with your friends, make voice calls, and enjoy the fun. It&#39;s easy to add folks from your contacts or share your buz ID.<br><br>Pssst\u2026 Make sure you\u2019re connected to WiFi or have a data plan to enjoy smooth chatting and avoid unexpected charges.<br><br><br>Want to help us make buz even better?<br>We value your feedback and want to hear your t